/+  pill
/+  hoot-zpdt
/+  cor=nock-compilation
::
:-  %say  |=  [[now=@da eny=@uvJ bec=beak] *]  :-  %noun
::
=/  sys=path  /(scot %p p.bec)/base/(scot %da now)/sys
=/  memo-call
=>  ..ride  !.
|*  [g=gate v=*]
%-  need  %-  ~(mole vi |)
|.  =>  [g=g v=v]
~>  %memo./user
(g v)
::
=/  ivory  (ivory:pill sys)
?>  ?=(%ivory -.ivory)
:: =^  prod  cor
::   =/  sub  ..ride:hoot-zpdt
::   =/  fol=^
::     ;;  ^
::     =>  sub  !.  !=
::     (ride %noun '42')
::   ::
::   ~>  %bout.[0 'ride analysis']
::   (memo-call poke:cor %full sub fol)
::
=^  prod  cor
  ~>  %bout.[0 'ivory analysis']
  (poke:cor %full +.p.ivory -.p.ivory)
~